OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA largely
OL,6,Ffine evening, but cloud will continue
OL,7,Fto thicken across Cumbria with patchy
OL,8,Frain arriving here through the early
OL,9,Fhours. The rain will drift slowly
OL,10,Fsouthwards overnight but many southern
OL,11,Fareas staying dry.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA bright start in the south,
OL,14,Fotherwise a cloudier day with limited
OL,15,Fbright spells. Patchy outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain also developing, especially
OL,17,Facross Cumbria, but light rain still
OL,18,Fpossible further south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
