OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure will bring a settled few days
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunshine across the
OL,8,Fregion. Feeling increasingly hot as
OL,9,Fthe week progresses with nights also
OL,10,Fbecome warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
